meta {
  name: A pattern or a range, not both
  type: http
  seq: 82
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/timetable-export.xlsx?branch_id={{branchId}}&from=2026-11-02&to=2026-11-09
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

headers {
  X-School-Id: {{schoolCode}}
}

assert {
  res.status: eq 400
}

docs {
  from and to describe a range of dates and need mode=range. Sending `on`
  alongside mode=range is refused the same way, and mode=range without from and
  to is refused too.

  Neither silently wins, because the two modes produce different documents and
  a caller holding the wrong one cannot tell. A wall chart of one particular
  fortnight looks exactly like a wall chart of the term.
}
